  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>tan</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>cot</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Left Hand and Right Hand Derivatives are not same so function is non derivable at&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;does not exist for all values in the given interval.</p>",
